#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Arbitrary-precision binary, decimal, and ball arithmetic for MoonBit, with checked operations and explicit numeric semantics."
msgstr "面向 MoonBit 的任意精度二进制、十进制与球（区间）算术，提供 checked 运算和显式的数值语义。"

