msgid "`ball_float_checked` API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:3
msgid "`BallFloatResult` wraps `Result[BallFloat, ArithmeticError]` while preserving interval semantics."
msgstr "`BallFloatResult` 包装 `Result[BallFloat, ArithmeticError]`，同时保留区间语义。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:6
#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:6
