msgstr "构造与观察"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:8
msgid "`ok`, `err`, `from_result`, and `result` bridge raw results. `exact`, `from_bounds`, `whole`, `from_int`, `from_coefficient`, `from_float`, and `from_double` construct wrapped intervals. Invalid bounds become `Err`."
msgstr "`ok`、`err`、`from_result`、`result` 连接原始结果；`exact`、`from_bounds`、`whole` 及各类 `from_*` 构造包装区间。非法边界返回 `Err`。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:12
msgid "`from_coefficient` takes `@bin_float.BinCoeff` plus the independent `negative?` sign flag; binary checked APIs do not accept `BigInt`."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:15
msgid "Composition And Arithmetic"
msgstr "组合与算术"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:17
#, fuzzy
msgid "`map`, `bind`, and `flat_map` short-circuit existing errors. `abs`, `neg`, `add`, `sub`, `mul`, `div`, `pow_nat`, `pow_int`, `normalized`, and `with_precision` return `BallFloatResult`; standard arithmetic operators are implemented."
msgstr "`map`、`bind`、`flat_map` 会短路已有错误。绝对值、取负、四则运算、整数幂、规范化与精度调整均返回 `Self`，并实现标准运算符。"

#: manual/api/ball_float_checked.md:22
msgid "Division by an interval containing zero follows `BallFloat` semantics and returns the whole-real enclosure. It is not converted into `Err`."
msgstr "除数区间含零时会按 `BallFloat` 语义返回 whole-real enclosure，不会转成 `Err`。"

