msgstr "[Tutorial](../tutorial/bin_float.md) 给出推荐构造与 context 流程。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:177
msgid "[Conformance](../conformance/bin_float.md) states the pinned TestFloat/MPFR claim and its exclusions."
msgstr "[Conformance](../conformance/bin_float.md) 限定 TestFloat/MPFR 声明。"

#: manual/design/bin_float.md:179
msgid "[Performance](../performance/bin_float.md) records target-specific dispatch evidence and the immutable release comparison baseline."
msgstr "[Performance](../performance/bin_float.md) 记录 target-specific dispatch 与固定发布对比基线。"

#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:1
msgid "`bin_float_checked` Design"
msgstr "`bin_float_checked` 设计"

#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:3
msgid "`BinFloatResult` is a closed `Result[BinFloat, ArithmeticError]` pipeline. Constructors validate at the edge; unary methods map successful values; binary methods short-circuit the left error before the right and invoke checked scalar operations only when both succeed. `bind` may change success to failure; `map` cannot. `flat_map` remains only as a deprecated alias."
msgstr "`BinFloatResult` 是封闭的 `Result[BinFloat, ArithmeticError]` 流水线。构造器在边界校验；一元操作只映射成功值；二元操作按从左到右保留首个错误，仅在双方成功时调用 checked 标量算法。`bind` 可引入新错误，`map` 不可；`flat_map` 只是 deprecated 别名。"

#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:9
msgid "The package adds no arithmetic algorithm, context flags, IEEE interchange, or error recovery. It preserves the first checked error and delegates all numeric semantics to `bin_float`. Its operation set is intentionally limited to the methods in the generated interface; contextual IEEE pipelines still use the underlying `(value, flags)` APIs directly."
msgstr "本包不新增算术、IEEE flags、互换或恢复策略，所有数值语义委托给 `bin_float`。上下文 IEEE 流程仍应直接使用底层 `(value, flags)` API。"

#: manual/design/bin_float_checked.md:15
msgid "Each wrapper step is `O(1)` beyond the delegated numeric operation and stores one `Result`. A separate wrapper was chosen instead of hiding errors inside `BinFloat` so ordinary values remain usable in algebraic code while checked pipelines preserve the first failure explicitly."
msgstr "每个 wrapper 步骤除底层数值操作外只增加 `O(1)` 成本。独立 wrapper 避免把错误状态塞进 `BinFloat`，使普通代数值与显式短路流水线保持两个清晰契约。"

