#: manual/design/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:1
msgid "`cli/gda_expr_cli` Design"
msgstr "`cli/gda_expr_cli` 设计"

#: manual/design/cli/gda_expr_cli.md:9
msgid "It expands inputs, reads each source once, delegates parsing/execution to `frontend/gda_expr`, then renders text or schema-versioned JSON."
