#: manual/tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md:1
msgid "`frontend/gda_expr` Tutorial"
msgstr "`frontend/gda_expr` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md:3
msgid "Repository Workflow"
msgstr "仓库流程"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md:5
msgid "Use `just conformance smoke decimal_gda` for the checked-in fixture, `just conformance run decimal_gda --phase ... --cases ...` while fixing Decimal semantics, `just pr` for the fast pre-PR gate, and `just ci` for the complete repository gate. The command reference is in [Decimal Conformance Data](../../../../testdata/decimal/README.md)."
msgstr "仓库内 fixture 使用 `just conformance smoke decimal_gda`；修复 Decimal 语义时使用定向的 `just conformance run decimal_gda --phase ... --cases ...`；PR 前运行快速 `just pr`，发布前运行完整 `just ci`。完整参数见[一致性测试数据](../../../../testdata/decimal/README.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md:10
msgid "Direct CLI Use"
msgstr "直接使用 CLI"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/gda_expr.md:18
msgid "Direct CLI runs skip `moon check` and `moon info`. Use the standard gate before publishing. The official corpus's diagnostic rows are only `#` placeholder or non-scalar invalid inputs; legal GDA rows are executed and must pass. Any legacy/unsupported classification is a regression signal."
msgstr "直接 CLI 不执行 `moon check` 和 `moon info`。官方语料的 diagnostic 只对应 `#` 占位/非标量非法输入；合法 GDA 行全部执行并通过，任何 legacy/unsupported 都应视为回归。"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md:1
msgid "`frontend/itl_expr` Tutorial"
msgstr "`frontend/itl_expr` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md:3
msgid "Use the repository smoke gate for an end-to-end check:"
msgstr "先运行端到端 smoke："

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/itl_expr.md:9
msgid "Library callers parse text, iterate cases through `execute_case`, then call `summarize_results`. Treat `Unsupported` separately from executable failures; enable strict behavior at the CLI/tooling layer when unsupported rows must fail."
msgstr "库调用方先 parse，再逐 case 执行并 summarize。Unsupported 不应与 executable failure 混为一谈；需要严格模式时由 CLI/tooling 提升为失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:1
msgid "`frontend/mpfr_expr` Tutorial"
msgstr "`frontend/mpfr_expr` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:3
msgid "Run the committed binary fixture through the shared workflow:"
msgstr "通过共享工作流运行仓库内 fixture："

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/mpfr_expr.md:9
msgid "For direct library use, select the parser matching the corpus grammar, execute the returned document, and require `summary.success()`. Do not auto-reinterpret parser diagnostics as unsupported arithmetic."
msgstr "直接调用时应按语料语法选择 parser，执行 document 并检查 `summary.success()`；不要把 parser 诊断改写成不支持的数值运算。"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:1
msgid "`frontend/testfloat_expr` Tutorial"
msgstr "`frontend/testfloat_expr` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:3
msgid "Use the checked-in vectors first:"
msgstr "先运行仓库内向量："

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:9
msgid "Library callers build a `TestFloatSpec`, parse one vector source, construct `RunOptions` for an optional shard, then execute the document. Keep function metadata explicit rather than inferring it from a path."
msgstr "库调用方构造 `TestFloatSpec`、解析一个向量源、可选设置 `RunOptions` shard，再执行 document。function 元数据必须显式提供，不能从路径猜测。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal.md:1
