msgstr "从 `src/internal` 中的构造入口或主入口开始。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:1
msgid "`internal/conformance` Tutorial"
msgstr "`internal/conformance` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:19
msgid "The package performs no parsing, arithmetic, IO, or scheduling effects. Do not import this package as a substitute for the numeric packages it supports."
msgstr "本包不执行解析、算术、IO 或调度副作用。 不要把本包当作其所支撑数值包的替代入口。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/conformance.md:23
msgid "Read [API](../../api/internal/conformance.md) for the complete generated surface and [Design](../../design/internal/conformance.md) for ownership and trade-offs."
