#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:1
msgid "`internal/runner_cli` Tutorial"
msgstr "`internal/runner_cli` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:19
msgid "Filesystem reads and rendering are intentionally contained here; the conformance model and numeric frontends stay pure. Do not import this package as a substitute for the numeric packages it supports."
msgstr "文件系统读取与渲染有意集中在这里，conformance model 和数值 frontend 保持纯。 不要把本包当作其所支撑数值包的替代入口。"

#: manual/tutorial/internal/runner_cli.md:23
msgid "Read [API](../../api/internal/runner_cli.md) for the complete generated surface and [Design](../../design/internal/runner_cli.md) for ownership and trade-offs."
