#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:1
msgid "`numeric_expr` Tutorial"
msgstr "`numeric_expr` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:3
msgid "Separate Syntax From Numeric Semantics"
msgstr "分离语法与数值语义"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:5
msgid "Build expressions from `Literal` and `Operation`, then provide two callbacks to `evaluate`: one parses literal text into the backend value, and one dispatches an operation name over evaluated arguments."
msgstr "用 `Literal` 与 `Operation` 构造表达式，再向 `evaluate` 提供两个回调：一个把字面量文本解析为后端值，另一个按操作名处理已求值参数。"

#: manual/tutorial/numeric_expr.md:9
msgid "This split lets the same expression tree target `Decimal`, `BinFloat`, semantic values, or a test double. Preserve `SourceSpan` in frontend diagnostics instead of embedding filesystem behavior into the expression package."
msgstr "同一表达式树可面向 `Decimal`、`BinFloat`、语义值或测试替身。前端诊断应保留 `SourceSpan`，不要把文件系统策略塞入表达式包。"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:1
msgid "`semantic` Tutorial"
msgstr "`semantic` 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:3
msgid "Compare Representations At A Common Boundary"
msgstr "在公共边界比较表示"

#: manual/tutorial/semantic.md:18
msgid "Use semantic values in cross-representation tests, protocol boundaries, or diagnostics. Keep representation-specific precision and formatting behavior on the original concrete value."
msgstr "语义值适合跨表示测试、协议边界和诊断。precision、quantum 与格式行为仍应从原始具体值读取。"

#: manual/verification.md:1
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: manual/verification.md:3
msgid "The repository separates fast development checks from finite, reproducible conformance claims. Passing a corpus proves only the declared formats, operations, rounding modes, targets, and fixture revisions."
msgstr "仓库将快速开发检查与有限、可复现的 conformance 声明分开。通过一个语料只证明所声明的 format、operation、rounding mode、target 和固定 fixture revision。"

#: manual/verification.md:7
msgid "Verification Layers"
msgstr "验证层级"

#: manual/verification.md:9
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: manual/verification.md:9
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/verification.md:11
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: manual/verification.md:11
msgid "Locale/file/heading/link checks plus executable documentation examples"
msgstr "locale/file/heading/link 检查与可执行文档示例"

#: manual/verification.md:12
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "格式"

#: manual/verification.md:12
msgid "MoonBit formatter"
msgstr ""

#: manual/verification.md:13
msgid "Pull request"
msgstr "PR"

#: manual/verification.md:13
msgid "Generated interfaces, all-target checks, native tests, Python tests, smoke corpora"
msgstr "生成接口、全 target check、native test、Python test、smoke corpus"

#: manual/verification.md:14
msgid "IEEE decimal"
msgstr ""

#: manual/verification.md:14
msgid "Checked-in decimal32/64/128 DPD/BID vectors across supported targets"
msgstr "支持 target 上的 decimal32/64/128 DPD/BID fixture"

#: manual/verification.md:15
msgid "GDA decimal"
msgstr ""

#: manual/verification.md:15
msgid "Pinned `official` and `official0` `.decTest` legal scalar rows"
msgstr "固定 `official` 与 `official0` `.decTest` 合法标量行"

#: manual/verification.md:16
msgid "Binary"
msgstr ""

#: manual/verification.md:16
msgid "Pinned TestFloat level-1 matrix and MPFR data"
msgstr "固定 TestFloat level-1 matrix 与 MPFR 数据"

#: manual/verification.md:17
msgid "Interval"
msgstr ""

#: manual/verification.md:17
msgid "Pinned ITF1788 strict supported phases"
msgstr "固定 ITF1788 strict supported phases"

#: manual/verification.md:18
msgid "Complete"
msgstr "完整"

#: manual/verification.md:18
msgid "All generated-interface, target, unit, and conformance gates"
msgstr "全部生成接口、target、单元与 conformance gate"

#: manual/verification.md:20
msgid "Run the narrowest relevant check first, then broaden before release."
msgstr "先运行与改动最接近的窄检查，再在发布前逐步扩大范围。"

#: manual/verification.md:22
msgid "Shared Conformance Runner"
msgstr "统一 Conformance Runner"

#: manual/verification.md:24
msgid "All suites use one dispatcher:"
msgstr "所有 suite 使用同一个 dispatcher："

#: manual/verification.md:31
msgid "`decimal` means the independent IEEE decimal corpus; `decimal_gda` means GDA `.decTest`. `binary` combines TestFloat and MPFR sources. `interval` uses ITL."
msgstr "`decimal` 指独立 IEEE decimal corpus，`decimal_gda` 指 GDA `.decTest`；`binary` 组合 TestFloat 与 MPFR，`interval` 使用 ITL。"

#: manual/verification.md:34
msgid "`smoke` runs committed fixtures without downloading external corpora. `plan` shows deterministic tasks. `fetch` verifies pinned provenance before installing ignored data below `.tmp/`. `run` executes the chosen suite. Backend-specific filters, phases, targets, strict mode, sharding, and JSON output are documented under `testdata/*/README.md`."
msgstr "`smoke` 不下载外部语料，直接运行已提交 fixture；`plan` 显示确定性任务；`fetch` 验证固定 provenance 后把忽略数据装入 `.tmp/`；`run` 执行 suite。各 backend 的 filter、phase、target、strict mode、sharding 与 JSON 输出见 `testdata/*/README.md`。"

#: manual/verification.md:40
msgid "Published Claims"
msgstr "已发布声明"

#: manual/verification.md:42
msgid "**GDA:** all 64,986 legal executable scalar rows in the 144-file `official` corpus pass; all 16,124 legal rows in `official0` pass. The 141 `#` placeholder/non-scalar invalid rows are diagnostic exclusions, not unsupported legal behavior."
msgstr "**GDA：** 144 文件 `official` corpus 的 64,986 条合法 executable scalar row 全部通过，`official0` 的 16,124 条合法行全部通过；141 条 `#` placeholder/ non-scalar 非法行是 diagnostic exclusion，不是未支持的合法行为。"

#: manual/verification.md:46
msgid "**Binary:** 254,227,872 TestFloat vectors cover binary16/32/64/128 add, subtract, multiply, divide, square root, fused multiply-add, remainder, roundToIntegral, convertToInteger, and the six comparison predicates under five rounding directions, both tininess modes, and exact variants where they apply. The pinned MPFR square-root dataset adds 1,055 rows."
msgstr "**Binary：** 254,227,872 条 TestFloat vector 覆盖 binary16/32/64/128 的 add、subtract、multiply、divide、sqrt、融合乘加、remainder、roundToIntegral、convertToInteger 与六个比较谓词，涵盖五种 rounding direction、两种 tininess 以及适用的 exact 变体；固定 MPFR sqrt 数据另有 1,055 行。"

#: manual/verification.md:51
msgid "**IEEE decimal:** committed decimal32/64/128 DPD and BID fixtures cover encoding, special values, flags, core arithmetic, and all 1,024 DPD declets on native, Wasm, Wasm-GC, and JavaScript. LLVM is excluded from this gate."
msgstr "**IEEE decimal：** 已提交 decimal32/64/128 DPD/BID fixture 覆盖 encoding、 special value、flags、核心算术与全部 1,024 个 DPD declet；运行于 native、Wasm、 Wasm-GC、JavaScript，LLVM 不属于该 gate。"

#: manual/verification.md:54
msgid "**Interval:** the strict ITF1788 phases cover declared set, relation, observation, arithmetic, cancellation, elementary, power, trigonometric, FMA, integer-power, and extrema operations. Reverse operations remain unsupported."
msgstr "**Interval：** strict ITF1788 phases 覆盖声明的 set、relation、observation、 arithmetic、cancellation、elementary、power、trigonometric、FMA、integer-power 与 extrema；reverse operations 仍未支持。"

#: manual/verification.md:59
msgid "These are finite claims. They do not imply every IEEE 754 or IEEE 1788 operation, arbitrary resource sizes, every NaN payload policy, or unpinned future corpus revisions."
msgstr "这些都是有限声明，不代表 IEEE 754/1788 的所有 operation、任意资源规模、所有 NaN payload policy 或未来未固定的 corpus revision。"

#: manual/verification.md:63
msgid "Reproducibility"
msgstr "可复现性"

#: manual/verification.md:65
msgid "External artifacts are revision- and SHA-256-pinned in corpus manifests. Builds use backend-named outputs and isolated target directories so parallel jobs do not overwrite one another. Shards select deterministic case indices, and merged summaries retain exact totals and failed IDs."
msgstr "外部 artifact 的 revision 与 SHA-256 固定在 corpus manifest 中。构建使用按 backend 命名的输出和隔离 target 目录，并行 job 不会互相覆盖。Shard 按确定性 case index 选择，合并 summary 保留精确 total 与 failed ID。"

#: manual/verification.md:70
msgid "The MoonBit frontend parses and executes numeric rows. Python orchestrates downloads, task planning, subprocesses, target selection, and aggregation. An optional oracle is never silently replaced by a weaker implementation; missing requirements must be reported explicitly."
msgstr "MoonBit frontend 解析并执行数值行；Python 负责编排下载、task planning、subprocess、 target selection 和 aggregation。可选 oracle 缺失时不得静默换成较弱实现，必须明确报告缺失条件。"

#: manual/verification.md:75
msgid "Performance evidence is separate from semantic conformance. Benchmark manifests pin baseline source, dependencies, toolchain, target, schedule, sample count, and dispersion limits. A performance threshold never changes correctness."
msgstr "性能证据与语义 conformance 分离。Benchmark manifest 固定 baseline source、依赖、 toolchain、target、schedule、sample count 与 dispersion limit。性能阈值不定义正确性。"

#: manual/verification.md:79
msgid "Failure Triage"
msgstr "失败排查"

#: manual/verification.md:81
msgid "Re-run the failing backend with the smallest case, ID filter, phase, or shard that reproduces it."
msgstr "用最小 case、ID filter、phase 或 shard 复现对应 backend；"

#: manual/verification.md:83
msgid "Distinguish parse diagnostics, unsupported cases, legacy classifications, executable mismatches, and infrastructure failures."
msgstr "区分 parse diagnostic、unsupported、legacy、executable mismatch 与基础设施失败；"

#: manual/verification.md:85
msgid "Record expected value, actual value, flags, context, target, corpus revision, and command."
msgstr "记录 expected/actual value、flags、context、target、corpus revision 与命令；"

#: manual/verification.md:87
msgid "Run the matching white-box package test to decide whether the defect is in parsing, arithmetic, interchange, or aggregation."
msgstr "运行对应 white-box 包测试，定位 parser、arithmetic、interchange 或 aggregation；"

#: manual/verification.md:89
msgid "After a fix, run the focused case, committed smoke fixture, backend gate, and finally `just pr` or `just ci` as appropriate."
msgstr "修复后依次运行 focused case、smoke fixture、backend gate，最后运行 `just pr` 或 `just ci`。"

#: manual/verification.md:92
msgid "Do not weaken strict support, discard flags, or change the denominator to make a failing gate pass."
msgstr "不得通过降低 strict support、丢弃 flags 或改写分母让失败 gate 变绿。"

#: manual/verification.md:95
msgid "Release Gate"
msgstr "发布 Gate"

#: manual/verification.md:97
msgid "Before publishing:"
msgstr "发布前："

#: manual/verification.md:99
msgid "align `moon.mod`, root README, localized indexes, standards, and changelog;"
msgstr "对齐 `moon.mod`、根 README、三语索引、文档标准与 changelog；"

#: manual/verification.md:100
msgid "run `just docs` and inspect generated interface differences;"
msgstr "运行 `just docs` 并检查生成接口差异；"

#: manual/verification.md:101
msgid "run `just pr` during iteration;"
msgstr "迭代期间运行 `just pr`；"

#: manual/verification.md:102
msgid "run `just ci` for the release candidate;"
msgstr "对 release candidate 运行 `just ci`；"

#: manual/verification.md:103
msgid "publish through the repository GitHub Actions workflow."
msgstr "通过仓库 GitHub Actions workflow 发布。"

#: manual/verification.md:105
msgid "Local `moon publish` is not the Luna-Flow release path because organization credentials are supplied by the workflow."
msgstr "Luna-Flow 不使用本地 `moon publish` 作为发布路径；组织凭据由 workflow 提供。"

